WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose a small first step. The example turns “Clean the kitchen” into “Put five dishes in the sink.”

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The two-minute timer shows the selected task and remaining time. The screen offers Pause and Stop here.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The Stuck menu offers choices including “I don’t know where to start” and “It feels too big.”

